extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 15: Spirit West printed 62-65, read from the text layer. No hit point or S.D.C. formula is printed, so compose.js supplies both (1D6 S.D.C. as a practitioner of magic). P.P.E. prints as 2D4xlO+40 and trade goods as 2D6xlOO, read as 2D4x10+40 and 2D6x100 (BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT F53). Spells: all five Shamanistic Paradox spells are granted outright; five more at level one and three per level after come from the printed 64 list of 35, of any level. The book also allows Rifts England''s temporal magic for any of those picks, and the catalog holds none - the Time Master precedent from phase-world batch 9: grant the half that exists and say so. Two list names use the catalog''s spelling: Control & Enslave Entity and Dispel Magic Barriers. THE BOOK CONTRADICTS ITSELF ON THE SPIRIT BOW: printed 64''s fetish list gives it at level two, and printed 65''s standard equipment lists a Spirit Bow among the starting weapons; the stat block is followed and it is starting equipment. The +1 to save vs horror factor at levels 1, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 13 and 15 is stored as +1 base and one step at each later level. Impervious to possession has no save field and is an ability. The totem pick is not stored; see BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F56."
